# Layers + errors (mandatory)

**Domain:** Entities are pure Dart (no Flutter, no JSON). Use Cases are small with one `call()`. Repository interfaces live here.

**Data:** Models/DTOs (freezed + json_serializable) are not entities; map in the repository. Split remote vs local data sources. **Now:** local / fixture sources only (emulated ledger). **Later:** add remote for crypto prices (and only then for trading). Repositories handle mapping and exception → `Failure`. Handle offline and real-time data correctly.

**Presentation:** Widgets stay dumb. Talk only to Blocs/Cubits. Never call repositories or use cases from UI. No business logic in widgets.

**Errors:** Shared sealed/freezed `Failure` in `lib/core/error/`. Use Cases return `Either<Failure, T>` (or equivalent). Data converts exceptions → Failures. Blocs convert Failures → UI states.
